    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the highly regarded Blackfriary area of Trim, this detached three-bedroom bungalow occupies a generous site of approximately 0.3 acres, offering an excellent opportunity to create a wonderful family home in one of the town's most sought-after residential locations.\n\nExtending to approximately 96 sq.m. (1,033 sq.ft.), the accommodation comprises an entrance hall, spacious sitting room with open fireplace, separate dining room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. The layout offers well-proportioned living accommodation and provides an excellent canvas for modernisation and reconfiguration to suit contemporary living.\n\nAlthough the property requires complete refurbishment throughout, it offers enormous potential for extension and improvement, subject to the necessary planning permission and may qualify for unoccupancy grants. The substantial site provides generous gardens, ample parking and plenty of space for outdoor living.\n\nBlackfriary enjoys a mature residential setting within walking distance of Trim town centre, where an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and sporting facilities are readily available. Trim is renowned for its historic charm, riverside walks and the magnificent Trim Castle, while the M3 motorway provides convenient access to Dublin and surrounding areas.\n\nProperties with this level of potential, on sites of this size and in such a desirable location, rarely come to the market.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nHardwood panelled front door. Laminate oak flooring. Coving.\n\nSitting Room - \nFitted wall to wall shelving and tv unit. Mahogany fire surround. Carpeted. Coving.\n\nLiving Dining - \nPart laminate oak wood floor and part carpeted floor.\n\nKitchen - \nFitted floor and wall units. Tiled over countertop. Timesave dishwasher, Nordemende washing machine. P.V.C. back door. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nWall to wall mahogany 6 door wardrobes with central dressing table, 3 drawer unit and mirror. Carpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nFitted 4 door wardrobe, central 3 drawer unit with circular mirror. Carpeted.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nCarpeted.\n\nShower Room - \nHotpress with copper cylinder. Level access shower with Triton T90sr instant electric unit. w.c . wash hand basin. Fully tiled floor and walls.\n\nDetached garage/ workshop - \nLights & sockets, extending to 80.31 sq. m. / 864 sq. ft.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>All mains services are provided </li><li>Oil fired central heating </li><li>Detached garage and workshop</li><li>Block built boiler house. Outside lighting. </li><li>Tarmac back yard with vehicular access to rear</li><li>Pedestrian gated access to front </li><li>P.V.C. oil tank. P.V.C. fascia and soffit </li><li>P.V.C double glazed windows to rear</li><li>Hardwood double glazed windows to front </li><li>Wrought iron gates to rear and side access</ul>"
      },
